1
00:00:00,135 --> 00:00:01,605
(Amy:)Aha!

2
00:00:06,575 --> 00:00:09,515
- Can we go now?
- Hang on.

3
00:00:15,951 --> 00:00:18,321
- What are you doing?
- Isn't it obvious?

4
00:00:18,487 --> 00:00:22,257
(Amy:)I'm spreading my scent
to mark my territory.

5
00:00:24,459 --> 00:00:26,259
(Penny:)Come on, Amy,
that is not gonna work.

6
00:00:26,461 --> 00:00:29,091
(Amy:)Really? Because just before
you became my best friend...

7
00:00:29,264 --> 00:00:32,234
(Amy:)...I did this all over your apartment.

8
00:00:37,005 --> 00:00:39,435
Has your assistant
said anything about me?

9
00:00:39,608 --> 00:00:40,908
(Sheldon:)Oh, in fact, she has.

10
00:00:41,076 --> 00:00:45,406
(Sheldon:)Her exact words were
"What is that guy's problem?"

11
00:00:46,782 --> 00:00:50,682
(Raj:)I'm in her head. Let the dance begin.

12
00:00:52,287 --> 00:00:54,417
Here's your frozen yogurt, Dr. Cooper.

13
00:00:54,589 --> 00:00:55,849
(Leonard:)This should be fun.

14
00:00:56,024 --> 00:00:59,024
(Sheldon:)Half chocolate, half vanilla,
side by side, not swirled?

